    <h1>For the men and women who served. <em>One month free as a thank-you.</em></h1>
    <p>If you served in the U.S. or Canadian military, whether active duty, reserves, or honorably discharged, your second month with me is free. The first month at the standard $175 kicks off the build; the second month is on the house. Thank you for your service.</p>
  </div>
